    "**Book & Print** sets size, bleed, margins and the cover with spine. **Export PDF** runs the preflight check and offers print profiles. **View › Show Print Guides** draws the safe margin (dashed) and the bleed on the canvas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Book & Print** sets size, bleed, margins and the cover with spine. **Export PDF** runs the preflight check and offers print profiles. **View › Show Print Guides** draws the safe margin (dashed) and the bleed on the canvas."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Libro e stampa** imposta formato, abbondanza, margini e copertina con dorso. **Esporta PDF** offre la verifica prestampa e i profili di stampa. **Vista › Mostra guide di stampa** disegna sul canvas il margine sicuro (tratteggiato) e l’abbondanza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**File › New Book from Photos** picks an album; **New Book from Files** uses Finder. Choose the size, then the book template: paper, type and margins.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**File › New Book from Photos** picks an album; **New Book from Files** uses Finder. Choose the size, then the book template: paper, type and margins."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**File › Nuovo libro da Foto** sceglie un album; **Nuovo libro da file** usa il Finder. Scegli il formato e poi il modello del libro: carta, caratteri e margini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Insert › Text Box** or **Page Heading**. Double-click to type on the page.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Insert › Text Box** or **Page Heading**. Double-click to type on the page."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Inserisci › Box di testo** o **Titolo di pagina**. Doppio clic per scrivere nella pagina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Layout** picks the page layout. Drag the **Pages** thumbnails to reorder; ← → and ↑ ↓ move between pages and spreads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Layout** picks the page layout. Drag the **Pages** thumbnails to reorder; ← → and ↑ ↓ move between pages and spreads."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Impagina** sceglie il modello della pagina. Trascina le miniature delle **Pagine** per riordinarle; ← → e ↑ ↓ si spostano fra pagine e doppie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Print service** in **Book & Print** picks a printer’s product and size: it sets bleed and margins, adds the product’s checks to **Issues** and its export to **Export PDF**. Check the printer’s current requirements before ordering.": {
      "comment": "Help, Print topic.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Print service** in **Book & Print** picks a printer’s product and size: it sets bleed and margins, adds the product’s checks to **Issues** and its export to **Export PDF**. Check the printer’s current requirements before ordering."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Servizio di stampa** in **Libro e stampa** sceglie il prodotto e il formato di uno stampatore: imposta abbondanza e margini, aggiunge i controlli del prodotto a **Segnalazioni** e la sua esportazione a **Esporta PDF**. Prima di ordinare controlla i requisiti attuali dello stampatore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "6 to 120 points. Clear the value to use the inherited size.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6 to 120 points. Clear the value to use the inherited size."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da 6 a 120 punti. Cancella il valore per usare la dimensione ereditata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fixed picture box, red Futura headlines and a travel-poster cover.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A fixed picture box, red Futura headlines and a travel-poster cover."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Riquadro fisso, titoli Futura rossi e copertina da manifesto di viaggio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A grid, light paper and page numbers. For landscapes, stops and sequences.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A grid, light paper and page numbers. For landscapes, stops and sequences."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Griglia, carta chiara e folio. Per paesaggi, tappe e sequenze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
