    "⇧-click or ⌘-click selects several objects, and a drag on blank paper draws a selection rectangle. Drag one of them to move them all; **Arrange › Align** and **Distribute** line them up.": {
      "comment": "Help: the Lay out pages topic, about multiple selection.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⇧-click or ⌘-click selects several objects, and a drag on blank paper draws a selection rectangle. Drag one of them to move them all; **Arrange › Align** and **Distribute** line them up."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⇧-clic o ⌘-clic seleziona più oggetti, e trascinando sulla carta vuota si traccia un rettangolo di selezione. Trascinane uno per spostarli tutti; **Disponi › Allinea** e **Distribuisci** li mettono in ordine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⇧⌘N new page · ⌘D duplicate page · ⌘[ ⌘] previous and next page · ⌥⌘C crop · ⌥⌘E enhance · ⇧⌘F / ⇧⌘B front / back": {
